    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066380/extras/746d01306078ed732c9eb2c25dbb4d49.poster.avif?t=1695952876\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066380/extras/746d01306078ed732c9eb2c25dbb4d49.webm?t=1695952876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066380/extras/746d01306078ed732c9eb2c25dbb4d49.mp4?t=1695952876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066380/extras/4329d922b79e2bada3988367db3aca2b.webp?t=1695952876\" /></div><br>In an unfamiliar location with unfamiliar people. You are Elina and you're... That's a good question, who are you? Were you drugged? It's up to you to figure out how you got here and why, and the massive implications for the future... and the past.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066380/extras/a668edb5471ca9a99d1a20bbf8067c77.webp?t=1695952876\" /></div><br>How you treat your fellow captives will affect your ending. Will you trust them... or will you throw them to the wolves?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066380/extras/5314fca4a22799f72eee486a83d60de4.webp?t=1695952876\" /></div><br>You will be subject to a variety of puzzles, (mostly ciphers)(Most are skippable), to discover more about the facility, your companions... and yourself.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066380/extras/f51c61d88eac251fb16861ace82002ac.webp?t=1695952876\" /></div><br>The story contains 